    "notes": "Two exact creator CC0 full exteriors confirm the black-and-white keep group: main five exterior tiers, curved tiled eaves and gables, connected lower Watari/Inui volumes, small southeast Tatsumi and open vermilion Moon-viewing room, white lower vents and rough sloping stone base. Current whole, east/west, Moon room, ridge and Inui renders retain those forms at medium-fi scope. Individual stone courses, fine tile/crest profiles, unseen partitions and exact historic floor/datum heights remain estimates. The detached red bridge, gates, moat landscape, city, visitors and interiors are outside scope."
